---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Contact" description="Email contact@thetravelfact.com. There is no form.">
  <article class="shell page prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Write to the desk.</h1>
    <p>The only address is <a href="mailto:contact@thetravelfact.com">contact@thetravelfact.com</a>. There is no form on this site.</p>
    <p>Useful mail is a correction: the page, the number, and the official source that disagrees. We will change the figure and the date, or take the figure off.</p>
    <h2>What this inbox cannot do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Book, change, or refund a hotel, a tour, or a flight.</li>
      <li>Tell you whether you personally need a visa. Use the government link on the sheet.</li>
      <li>Give medical advice about water. The sheet only says what CDC's page does, or does not, say.</li>
      <li>Handle an emergency. Use local emergency services.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Please do not send passwords, passport numbers, or payment details.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
